DESCRIPTION:Mid Feb. SmartEX app\, a month ahead. Odawara → Kyoto on the direct Hikari around 14:07 (they run every two hours); Kyoto ⇄ Hiroshima 07:00 out\, ~19:15 back. JR changes its timetable in mid-March\, so use the times SmartEX shows.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
